# Hot-path performance

- No `.await` in capture / encode / decode / packetize loops
- Bounded queues only; **drop-oldest / latest-frame-wins** for video
- No heap allocation, locks, or logging above `debug` in per-frame steady state without measurement
- Annotate stages with `tracing` spans gated by feature `perf-trace` when added
- Input must never wait behind video
- Measure before micro-optimizing; record numbers in `docs/05_PERFORMANCE_BUDGET.md`
- Prefer buffer pools and `bytes::Bytes` reuse
